---
/**
 * LabPreview — a small, honest demonstration of the engineering method.
 *
 * Purpose distinct from Selected work: this section is about *how*
 * Stephen works, not what he shipped. It is a deterministic local
 * check on an illustrative fixture — no model call, no invented
 * result. The full payload pipeline lives on /lab/.
 *
 * The complete result is in the HTML. JavaScript only replays the
 * three checks as emphasis; it never gates the answer.
 */
---

<section class="lab-preview on-deck" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
  <div class="page-shell lab-preview__grid">
    <div class="lab-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / Reliability Lab</p>
      <h2 id="lab-title">Fluent isn’t<br />the same as true.</h2>
      {/* One idea, once: the claims the check objects to are set inside the
          sentence that describes them, the way a footnote would be. They are
          ordinary text, not decoration — a screen reader reads them in place. */}
      <p class="lead">
        A polished sentence can invent <span class="claim-tag">5 years</span> of experience and a
        <span class="claim-tag">40%</span> speed-up that nobody supplied. Here’s a rewrite that does
        exactly that, and the check that throws it out.
      </p>
      <p class="lab-notes">
        Made-up example. The checks run in your browser. No model is called.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link lab-copy__cta" href="/lab/">
        Open the Reliability Lab <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="check">
      <div class="check__head">
        <span class="check__title">cv.rewrite_bullet</span>
        <span class="check__tag">Illustrative</span>
      </div>

      <div class="check__body">
        <div class="check__block">
          <p class="check__label">Supplied context</p>
          <ul class="check__context">
            <li><b>requirement-2</b> Python and SQL</li>
            <li><b>evidence-1</b> Class project analysing 1,200 sales records</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="check__block">
          <p class="check__label">Proposed bullet</p>
          <p class="check__proposal">
            “Results-driven engineer with <mark>5 years of Kubernetes experience</mark> who
            transformed deployments at Acme Corp.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="check__steps" aria-label="What the checks do">
          <li><span class="check__n">01</span> Parse the proposal as JSON</li>
          <li><span class="check__n">02</span> Require a requirement and an evidence citation</li>
          <li><span class="check__n">03</span> Return it to a person for review</li>
        </ol>

        <p class="check__verdict">
          <span class="check__x" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
          <span>
            <strong>Refused.</strong> “Kubernetes” and “Acme Corp” are not in the supplied
            evidence, and the proposal cites no source ids. Nothing is applied.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- No replay button: a canned animation would be theatre. The
           worked example stands still, and the real instrument is one
           link away, where you supply your own text. -->
      <div class="check__foot">
        <p class="check__status">
          Your browser runs the same check on the Lab page, against whatever you write.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .lab-preview {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5rem);
  }
  .lab-preview__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    /* The copy is shorter than the instrument; aligning the first line
       of each keeps the pair reading as one spread. */
    align-items: start;
  }

  .lab-copy {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .lab-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.7rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .lab-copy .lead {
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.2vw, 1.06rem);
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-muted);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }
  /* ---- the inline claims ------------------------------------------
     Small objects sitting in the line: a hairline box on the page's own
     paper, a resting angle, and a shadow shallow enough to stay in the
     text block. At phone widths the angle goes and they sit flat, so
     they never collide with the line above. */
  .claim-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-inline: 0.12em;
    padding: 0.06em 0.42em 0.1em;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);
    background: var(--color-sheet-raised);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    rotate: -1.4deg;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .claim-tag + .claim-tag {
    rotate: 1.2deg;
  }
  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .claim-tag {
      rotate: 0deg;
    }
    .claim-tag + .claim-tag {
      rotate: 0deg;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .claim-tag {
      rotate: 0deg;
    }
    .claim-tag + .claim-tag {
      rotate: 0deg;
    }
  }

  .lab-notes {
    position: relative;
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    max-width: 42ch;
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-muted);
  }
  .lab-notes::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.7em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent-bright);
  }
  .lab-copy__cta {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--color-teal-bright);
  }
  .lab-copy__cta:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-bright);
  }
  .lab-copy__cta :global(span) {
    color: inherit;
  }

  /* ---- the check ------------------------------------------- */
  .check {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
    background: var(--color-deck-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule-on-canvas);
    min-width: 0;
    position: relative;
  }
  .check::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: -1px;
    width: 2.6rem;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-accent-bright);
  }
  .check__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-on-canvas);
  }
  .check__title {
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-muted);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .check__tag {
    flex: none;
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-bright);
    border: 1px solid rgba(226, 128, 68, 0.45);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
  }
  .check__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
  }
  .check__label {
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-faint);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .check__context {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-muted);
  }
  .check__context b {
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--color-teal-bright);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }
  .check__proposal {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.7vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.32;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .check__proposal mark {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-signal-fail-bright, #e5a196);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-style: wavy;
    text-underline-offset: 0.24em;
  }

  .check__steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule-on-canvas);
  }
  .check__steps li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-on-canvas-soft, #1e2224);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-muted);
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: color var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-standard), border-color var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-standard),
      background var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-standard);
  }
  .check__steps li[data-on] {
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas);
    border-left-color: var(--color-accent-bright);
    background: rgba(226, 128, 68, 0.07);
  }
  .check__n {
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-faint);
  }
  .check__steps li[data-on] .check__n {
    color: var(--color-accent-bright);
  }

  .check__verdict {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-muted);
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    /* The two ends of the shared feedback pulse (styles/motion.css). */
    --feedback-rest: rgba(229, 161, 150, 0.35);
    --feedback-live: var(--color-signal-fail-bright, #e5a196);
    border: 1px solid var(--feedback-rest);
    background: rgba(149, 50, 60, 0.12);
  }
  .check__verdict strong {
    color: var(--color-signal-fail-bright, #e5a196);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .check__x {
    color: var(--color-signal-fail-bright, #e5a196);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  /* The pulse confirming the refusal is the site's shared feedback
     animation (styles/motion.css); the colours stay local to the verdict. */

  .check__foot {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule-on-canvas);
    background: var(--color-deck);
  }
  .check__status {
    font-family: var(--font-instrument);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-on-canvas-faint);
    max-width: 34ch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 60.01rem) {
    .lab-copy {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 60rem) {
    .lab-preview__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .check {
      grid-column: auto;
      grid-row: auto;
    }
    .lab-copy .lead {
      max-width: 56ch;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .check__head {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .check__foot {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .check__status {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
